	(text "Delta Temperature:\nP = ID^2 * Rds(on)\ndTemperature = P * ZthJC\n			= ID^2 * Rds(on) * ZthJC\nIf ID = 1A & 100% Duty Cycle\ndTemperature = 0.02625\n\nIf ID = 10A & 100% Duty Cycle\ndTemperature = 2.625\n\nIf ID = 30A & 100% Duty Cycle\ndTemperature = 23.625\n"
